{"id": "D1_001", "version": "1.0", "dataset_type": "D1", "created_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "governance_status": {"reviewed": true, "reviewer": "system", "approved_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "quality_score": 0.95}, "input": {"user_query": "Python是什么编程语言？", "conversation_history": [], "metadata": {"language": "zh", "intent_type": "fact", "complexity": "simple"}}, "output": {"response_strategy": "DIRECT", "confidence_score": 0.95, "final_response": "Python是一种高级编程语言，由Guido van Rossum于1991年创建。它以简洁、易读的语法著称，广泛应用于Web开发、数据分析、人工智能等领域。", "persona_consistency": true, "style_markers": {"citation_used": false, "conservative_tone": false, "retrieval_referenced": false}}, "quality_annotations": {"fluency": 0.95, "accuracy": 0.98, "helpfulness": 0.92}}
{"id": "D1_002", "version": "1.0", "dataset_type": "D1", "created_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "governance_status": {"reviewed": true, "reviewer": "system", "approved_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "quality_score": 0.93}, "input": {"user_query": "What is machine learning?", "conversation_history": [], "metadata": {"language": "en", "intent_type": "fact", "complexity": "simple"}}, "output": {"response_strategy": "DIRECT", "confidence_score": 0.94, "final_response": "Machine learning is a branch of artificial intelligence that enables computers to learn from data without being explicitly programmed. It includes techniques like supervised learning, unsupervised learning, and reinforcement learning.", "persona_consistency": true, "style_markers": {"citation_used": false, "conservative_tone": false, "retrieval_referenced": false}}, "quality_annotations": {"fluency": 0.94, "accuracy": 0.96, "helpfulness": 0.93}}
{"id": "D1_003", "version": "1.0", "dataset_type": "D1", "created_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "governance_status": {"reviewed": true, "reviewer": "system", "approved_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "quality_score": 0.91}, "input": {"user_query": "请解释一下什么是API", "conversation_history": [], "metadata": {"language": "zh", "intent_type": "fact", "complexity": "medium"}}, "output": {"response_strategy": "DIRECT", "confidence_score": 0.92, "final_response": "API（Application Programming Interface，应用程序编程接口）是一组定义、协议和工具，用于构建软件应用程序。它规定了软件组件之间如何交互，使得开发者可以使用预定义的功能而无需了解底层实现细节。", "persona_consistency": true, "style_markers": {"citation_used": false, "conservative_tone": false, "retrieval_referenced": false}}, "quality_annotations": {"fluency": 0.92, "accuracy": 0.94, "helpfulness": 0.90}}
{"id": "D1_004", "version": "1.0", "dataset_type": "D1", "created_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "governance_status": {"reviewed": true, "reviewer": "system", "approved_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "quality_score": 0.90}, "input": {"user_query": "How does cloud computing work?", "conversation_history": [], "metadata": {"language": "en", "intent_type": "fact", "complexity": "medium"}}, "output": {"response_strategy": "DIRECT", "confidence_score": 0.91, "final_response": "Cloud computing delivers computing services—including servers, storage, databases, networking, software—over the Internet. Instead of owning and maintaining physical data centers, companies can access technology services on an as-needed basis from cloud providers like AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud.", "persona_consistency": true, "style_markers": {"citation_used": false, "conservative_tone": false, "retrieval_referenced": false}}, "quality_annotations": {"fluency": 0.93, "accuracy": 0.92, "helpfulness": 0.88}}
{"id": "D1_005", "version": "1.0", "dataset_type": "D1", "created_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "governance_status": {"reviewed": true, "reviewer": "system", "approved_at": "2026-04-18T10:00:00Z", "quality_score": 0.94}, "input": {"user_query": "数据库索引的作用是什么", "conversation_history": [], "metadata": {"language": "zh", "intent_type": "fact", "complexity": "medium"}}, "output": {"response_strategy": "DIRECT", "confidence_score": 0.93, "final_response": "数据库索引是一种数据结构，用于提高数据检索速度。它类似于书籍的目录，可以让数据库系统快速定位到特定数据，而无需扫描整个表。常见的索引类型包括B树索引、哈希索引和全文索引。", "persona_consistency": true, "style_markers": {"citation_used": false, "conservative_tone": false, "retrieval_referenced": false}}, "quality_annotations": {"fluency": 0.94, "accuracy": 0.95, "helpfulness": 0.91}}
